   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s tels que formul&#xe9;s par l&#x2019;IITA comprennent : 1) nombre accru d&apos;organisations publiant des donn&#xe9;es sur l&apos;aide conform&#xe9;ment &#xe0; la norme de l&apos;IITA; 2) qualit&#xe9; et actualit&#xe9; des donn&#xe9;es de l&apos;lITA am&#xe9;lior&#xe9;es; 3) utilisation accrue des donn&#xe9;es de I&apos;lITA par les pays partenaires, les donateurs et d&#x2019;autres parties prenantes, menant &#xe0; une coop&#xe9;ration au d&#xe9;veloppement plus efficace en soutien aux efforts de d&#xe9;veloppement durable.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes as stated by IATI include: (1) increased number of organizations publishing aid data in accordance with the IATI standard; (2) improved quality and timeliness of IATI data; and (3) increased use of IATI data by partner countries, donor agencies and other stakeholders, leading to more effective development cooperation in support of sustainable development efforts.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
